WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.862
Lab 1.

2
00:00:00.862 --> 00:00:02.250
Six tests pass.

3
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.212
Then run the check on the
two fictional exports.

4
00:00:05.212 --> 00:00:10.088
Entra inbound provisioning writes eight
attributes and SailPoint writes seven.

5
00:00:10.088 --> 00:00:13.277
Department is a Finding:
both systems update it,

6
00:00:13.277 --> 00:00:16.875
so each overwrites the other
and drift never settles.

7
00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:21.563
Display name is a Warning: one updates
it and the other sets it at creation.

8
00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:25.337
Two attributes are only Info,
set by both at creation.

9
00:00:25.337 --> 00:00:27.700
The command fails because of that Finding.
